<!doctype html><html lang="zh"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><link rel="icon" href="data:,"><title>GNM 女性研究头 · 皮肤与毛发</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="experiment.css"><script type="importmap">{"imports":{"female-neck-safety":"./src/FemaleGroomSafety.js","three":"./vendor/three.module.js","orbit-controls":"./vendor/OrbitControls.js","gnm-model":"./src/GNMModel.js","gnm-samplers":"./src/SemanticSampler.js","gnm-scalp":"./src/ScalpBinding.js","legacy-hair":"./src/HairLayer.js","legacy-facial":"./src/FacialHairLayer.js","teacher-binding":"./src/TeacherGroomBinding.js","teacher-data":"./data/teacher-groom.js","fiber-material":"./src/FiberMaterial.js","gnm-expression-sources":"./src/ExpressionSources.js","hair-opacity-shadows":"./src/HairOpacityShadows.js","teacher-editor":"./src/TeacherGroomEditor.js","gnm-skin-material":"./src/ProceduralSkinMaterial.js","gnm-uv-render":"./src/GnmUvRenderMesh.js"}}</script></head><body><header><a href="../gnm-groom-editor/experiment.html">← 毛发编辑</a><strong>GNM 女性研究头</strong><a href="../gnm-opacity-experiment/experiment.html">R8 质感对照</a></header><main>
<section id="cameraDeck" aria-label="旋转与视角"><div class="row camera-primary"><button id="rotate" aria-pressed="false">▶ 自动旋转</button><button id="turnLeft" aria-label="向左旋转15度">↶ 左转</button><button id="turnRight" aria-label="向右旋转15度">右转 ↷</button><button id="minus" aria-label="缩小">−</button><output id="zoom">100%</output><button id="plus" aria-label="放大">＋</button><button id="reset">视角归位</button></div><div class="row camera-views"><span>手动：拖动人像旋转 · 双指缩放</span><button data-view="front">正面</button><button data-view="three" class="selected">斜侧</button><button data-view="side">侧面</button><button data-view="back">背面</button></div></section>
<section id="stage"><canvas id="canvas" aria-label="三维人像，可拖动旋转"></canvas><div id="loading"><strong id="loadingText">读取完整 GNM 模型</strong><progress id="progress" max="1" value="0"></progress></div><div id="error" hidden></div></section>
<section id="controls"><nav class="row editor-tabs" aria-label="毛发调整部位"><button data-panel="hair" class="selected" aria-pressed="true">头发</button><button data-panel="brows" aria-pressed="false">眉毛</button><button data-panel="beard" aria-pressed="false">胡须</button><button data-panel="skin" aria-pressed="false">皮肤</button><button data-panel="look" aria-pressed="false">灯光</button><button id="resetAll">恢复毛发</button></nav>
<section id="panel-hair" class="editor-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h1>发型</h1><button id="hairVisible" aria-pressed="true">头发：显示</button></div><div class="presets" aria-label="发型预设"><button data-style="original" class="selected">原老师长发</button><button data-style="chin-trim">中长裁剪</button><button data-style="cropped-trim">短层裁剪</button></div><details id="legacyStyles"><summary>旧短发结构对照 · 外观待改进</summary><p>保留三种真实头皮短发练习；发际线和整体外观尚未达到当前长发质量</p><div class="presets legacy-presets"><button data-style="side-sweep">短侧分</button><button data-style="swept-back">后梳短发</button><button data-style="short-crop">短寸</button></div></details><div class="preset-end" hidden></div><p id="styleNote">保留老师原发缝与三维发束；裁剪沿原曲线，不重画发根</p><div class="editor-grid"><label class="color" for="hairColor">发色<input id="hairColor" type="color" value="#291c12"></label><div class="swatches" aria-label="常用发色"><button data-color="#17130f" aria-label="黑色" style="--swatch:#17130f"></button><button data-color="#291c12" aria-label="深棕" style="--swatch:#291c12"></button><button data-color="#63341e" aria-label="栗棕" style="--swatch:#63341e"></button><button data-color="#ba7938" aria-label="金棕" style="--swatch:#ba7938"></button><button data-color="#87837b" aria-label="灰白" style="--swatch:#87837b"></button></div><label class="slider" for="hairLength"><span>长度</span><output id="hairLengthValue"></output><input id="hairLength" type="range" min="45" max="100" step="1" value="100"></label><label class="slider" for="hairDensity"><span>密度</span><output id="hairDensityValue"></output><input id="hairDensity" type="range" min="10" max="100" step="1" value="100"></label><label class="slider" for="hairWidth"><span>丝径</span><output id="hairWidthValue"></output><input id="hairWidth" type="range" min="50" max="160" step="1" value="100"></label><label class="slider" for="hairRoughness"><span>粗糙度</span><output id="hairRoughnessValue"></output><input id="hairRoughness" type="range" min="20" max="80" step="1" value="46"></label></div><details id="shortShape"><summary>短发分区与蓬松</summary><p>这些形状参数用于后三种沿真实头皮生长的短发</p><div class="editor-grid"><label class="slider" for="hairVolume"><span>蓬松</span><output id="hairVolumeValue"></output><input id="hairVolume" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="35"></label><label class="slider" for="hairline"><span>发际线</span><output id="hairlineValue"></output><input id="hairline" type="range" min="-100" max="100" step="1" value="0"></label><label class="slider" for="frontCoverage"><span>前区覆盖</span><output id="frontCoverageValue"></output><input id="frontCoverage" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="100"></label><label class="slider" for="sideCoverage"><span>两侧覆盖</span><output id="sideCoverageValue"></output><input id="sideCoverage" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="100"></label><label class="slider" for="backCoverage"><span>后区覆盖</span><output id="backCoverageValue"></output><input id="backCoverage" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="100"></label></div></details></section>
<section id="panel-brows" class="editor-panel" hidden><div class="panel-heading"><h1>眉毛</h1><button id="browsVisible" aria-pressed="true">眉毛：显示</button></div><div class="row"><button data-brow-preset="natural">原自然眉</button><button data-brow-preset="soft">清淡眉</button><button data-brow-preset="full">浓眉</button><button id="browsMatch">跟随发色</button></div><p>沿老师原眉毛方向裁剪；发根继续绑定真实皮肤</p><div class="editor-grid"><label class="color" for="browsColor">眉色<input id="browsColor" type="color" value="#21170f"></label><label class="slider" for="browsDensity"><span>密度</span><output id="browsDensityValue"></output><input id="browsDensity" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="100"></label><label class="slider" for="browsLength"><span>长度</span><output id="browsLengthValue"></output><input id="browsLength" type="range" min="45" max="100" step="1" value="100"></label><label class="slider" for="browsWidth"><span>丝径</span><output id="browsWidthValue"></output><input id="browsWidth" type="range" min="50" max="160" step="1" value="100"></label></div></section>
<section id="panel-beard" class="editor-panel" hidden><div class="panel-heading"><h1>胡须</h1><button id="beardVisible" aria-pressed="false">胡须：隐藏</button></div><div class="row"><button data-beard-preset="none">无胡须</button><button data-beard-preset="stubble">短胡茬</button><button data-beard-preset="moustache">上唇须</button><button data-beard-preset="goatee">山羊胡</button><button data-beard-preset="both">唇须 + 下巴</button><button id="beardMatch">跟随发色</button></div><p>当前支持上唇与下巴两个真实皮肤区域；不包含脸颊络腮胡</p><div class="editor-grid"><label class="color" for="beardColor">胡须颜色<input id="beardColor" type="color" value="#291c12"></label><label class="slider" for="beardDensity"><span>密度</span><output id="beardDensityValue"></output><input id="beardDensity" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="60"></label><label class="slider" for="beardLength"><span>长度</span><output id="beardLengthValue"></output><input id="beardLength" type="range" min="8" max="80" step="1" value="35"></label><label class="slider" for="beardWidth"><span>丝径</span><output id="beardWidthValue"></output><input id="beardWidth" type="range" min="50" max="160" step="1" value="100"></label><label class="slider" for="moustacheCoverage"><span>上唇覆盖</span><output id="moustacheCoverageValue"></output><input id="moustacheCoverage" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="100"></label><label class="slider" for="chinCoverage"><span>下巴覆盖</span><output id="chinCoverageValue"></output><input id="chinCoverage" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="100"></label></div></section>
<section id="panel-skin" class="editor-panel" hidden><div class="panel-heading"><h1>程序皮肤研究</h1><button id="skinReset">恢复基础皮肤</button></div><div class="row"><button data-skin-mode="skin" class="selected">基础皮肤</button><button data-skin-mode="clay">R9 灰模对照</button><button data-skin-mode="uv">官方 UV 检查</button></div><p>真实 GNM 皮肤区域 · 独立程序材质，未使用扫描皮肤贴图 · 眼睛、牙齿和舌头各自分区</p><div class="editor-grid"><label class="color" for="skinColor">基础肤色<input id="skinColor" type="color" value="#bea099"></label><label class="slider" for="skinRoughness"><span>粗糙度</span><output id="skinRoughnessValue">60%</output><input id="skinRoughness" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="60"></label><label class="slider" for="skinDetail"><span>微表面</span><output id="skinDetailValue">30%</output><input id="skinDetail" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="30"></label><label class="slider" for="skinFlush"><span>局部血色</span><output id="skinFlushValue">32%</output><input id="skinFlush" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="32"></label><label class="slider" for="skinSoftness"><span>薄处柔光</span><output id="skinSoftnessValue">25%</output><input id="skinSoftness" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="25"></label><label class="slider" for="skinNormalStrength"><span>导入法线强度</span><output id="skinNormalStrengthValue">65%</output><input id="skinNormalStrength" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="65"></label></div><details id="skinMapImport"><summary>导入自己的皮肤贴图</summary><p>只在当前浏览器内读取，不上传。贴图须匹配官方 GNM UV；不会自动把其他 UV 的人脸图片贴准。颜色按 sRGB 读取，法线和粗糙度按线性数据读取</p><div class="skin-file-grid"><label for="skinMap-color">肤色 / Albedo<input id="skinMap-color" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"><small id="skinMapInfo-color">未导入</small></label><button data-clear-map="color">清除</button><label for="skinMap-normal">法线 / OpenGL<input id="skinMap-normal" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"><small id="skinMapInfo-normal">未导入</small></label><button data-clear-map="normal">清除</button><label for="skinMap-roughness">粗糙度 / 绿通道<input id="skinMap-roughness" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"><small id="skinMapInfo-roughness">未导入</small></label><button data-clear-map="roughness">清除</button></div></details><p id="skinStatus" role="status">默认使用程序基础皮肤；柔光是轻量近似，并非完整皮下多重散射</p></section><section id="panel-look" class="editor-panel" hidden><h1>灯光与表情</h1><div class="row"><button data-light="both" class="selected">冷暖双灯</button><button data-light="warm">暖光</button><button data-light="cool">冷光</button><button data-light="ambient">环境光</button></div><div class="row"><button data-case="neutral" class="selected">中性</button><button data-case="smile">笑</button><button data-case="surprise">惊讶</button><button data-case="identity">女性备选</button></div><div class="row"><button data-shadow-mode="layered" class="selected" disabled>R8 分层投影</button><button data-shadow-mode="stochastic">旧投影对照</button><button id="shadows" aria-pressed="true">发丝投影：开</button><button id="coverage" aria-pressed="true">细丝覆盖：开</button></div><p>女性头形独立生成，光源与纤维材质保留 R8 基线；皮肤材质在独立页研究。支持分层投影的设备默认使用已确认的质感；不支持时清楚提示回退</p></section>
<p id="status" role="status">载入毛发编辑器…</p><p id="opacityStatus" role="status">检查分层累计能力…</p><details><summary>来源与已知边界</summary><p>这是 GNM 官方 FEMALE 语义采样器生成的新女性研究身份，不是 TEN24 那位女士。皮肤是独立程序材质，未使用 TEN24 或其他扫描皮肤资产。默认与备选身份固定种子，重置不会换回男性；女性发根随真实当前头皮求值。</p><p>前三款为 Daniel Bystedt 的 Blender 官方 Hair Styles 原三维发束及沿线裁剪，CC BY-SA 署名与同许可保留。后三款沿 GNM 真实头皮表面生成；六款共用 R8 材质和灯光。胡须覆盖仅限上唇与下巴。</p><p>本页程序皮肤尚未完成真实感验收。原曲线仍有少量发根半径接触未达标。新增裁剪只取原线段子集，并非完整碰撞求解。未验证实体手机性能；软件 GPU 测试很慢，不作实时帧率承诺。</p><p><a href="https://www.blender.org/download/demo-files/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Blender 官方源案例</a> · <a href="TEACHER-GROOM-PROVENANCE.json" target="_blank">数据改作说明</a> · <a href="../gnm-opacity-experiment/experiment.html">保留的 R8 对照页</a></p></details></section></main><script type="module" src="src/experiment.js"></script></body></html>